exports[`side thread prompts snapshots each quick action prompt 1`] = `
{
  "challenge": 
"# Side thread: challenge

## Source provenance
- sessionId: sess-9
- messageId: msg-42

## Source message
The system is always consistent under partition.

## Intent
Challenge the source answer: find the strongest counter-case and where it would fail.

## Examples
Treat the source message as the only starting artifact. Quote it when objecting.

## Constraints
Stay attached to source message msg-42 in session sess-9.
Do not silently switch topics.

## Requirements
Give the best opposing argument, then a fair residual-confidence note.

## Skills
Use verification, structured critique, and explicit uncertainty.

## Risk
Stay on the original claim. No unrelated debates.

## Evidence
Prefer quotes from the source. Separate evidence from inference.

## Output schema
- verdict
- findings[] (claim, status, note)
- next_checks[]

## Hardness
high"
,
  "concise": 
