Prefer quotes from the source. Separate evidence from inference.

## Output schema
- verdict
- findings[] (claim, status, note)
- next_checks[]

## Hardness
medium"
,
  "grill": 
"# Side thread: grill

## Source provenance
- sessionId: sess-9
- messageId: msg-42

## Source message
The system is always consistent under partition.

## Intent
Strictly verify the source answer. Attack weak claims, demand evidence, and refuse to rubber-stamp.

## Examples
Treat the source message as the only starting artifact. Quote it when objecting.

## Constraints
Stay attached to source message msg-42 in session sess-9.
Do not silently switch topics.

## Requirements
List failures first. Cite the source passage for every objection.

## Skills
Use verification, structured critique, and explicit uncertainty.

## Risk
Do not invent facts. Mark speculation explicitly.

## Evidence
Prefer quotes from the source. Separate evidence from inference.

## Output schema
- verdict
- findings[] (claim, status, note)
- next_checks[]

